# GMS's 10+3x% of the pool a drink, out of a fountain the party walks up to.
# Nobody walks anywhere here, so it simply pours: the same amount, on a wait
# that shortens by half a second a level.
#
# Half seconds rather than whole ones because the drop from level 1 to 10 has
# to divide nine, and 7.5 is the nearest start to eight that does.
name: "Holy Fountain"
skill_order: 3
description: "Summons a Holy Fountain that restores your HP on its own."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
tags: SKILL_TAG_BENEVOLENCE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PRIEST
max_level: 10
base {
  regen_pct: 0.13
  regen_interval_seconds: 7.5
}
per_level {
  regen_pct: 0.03
  regen_interval_seconds: -0.5
}
